cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If BIDS Manager helped you prepare a dataset, please cite it as below,
  together with the tools your data went through (see "Citing BIDS Manager"
  in the documentation).
type: software
title: BIDS Manager
abstract: >-
  BIDS Manager prepares neuroimaging data in the Brain Imaging Data Structure
  (BIDS). It reads raw MRI, MR spectroscopy, PET, EEG, MEG, physiological and
  eye-tracking recordings, proposes a BIDS name for each one, converts them with
  the established engines, and then helps you complete, curate, inspect and
  validate the result. Every decision is shown and can be changed before
  anything is written, the metadata a recording cannot carry is asked for by the
  BIDS schema itself, and every change is recorded.
